### 署名与软件出版身份 / Attribution and software-publication identity

中文：作者、仓库开发者、科研结果验证人及外部机构不是同一身份；AST 工具、文档产物、CodeMeta 和 DOI 的存在不表示科研结论得到外部验证或认证

English: Authors, repository developers, research verifiers and institutions have distinct identities. AST tooling, document artifacts, CodeMeta and DOI presence do not certify scientific conclusions or third-party validation

